  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ayyanar vs The Commissioner on 11 July, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.15397 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 11.07.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.15397 of 2024 and W.M.P(MD)No.13500 of 2024 Ayyanar ... Petiti Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Food Safety & Drug Administration Department, Chennai. 2.The District Collector, Collectorate, Madurai District. 3.The Superintendent of Police, Madurai District, Madurai. 4.The Officer Incharge for Food Safety & Medical Administration Department, Office at Deputy Director of Welfare Works Complex, Viswanathapuram, Madurai. 5.The Inspector of Police, Pew Melur, Madurai District. ... Respond https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 Ayyanar vs The Commissioner on 11 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/188559320/ 1 W. Prayer: Writ petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, pertaining to the impug order passed by the fourth respondent in 0060/A2/2024/U.Pa.Thu dated 19.06.2024 and quash the same and consequently direct the fourth respondent to remove the lock and se the petitioner's shop, namely, Ayyanar Store Nattarmangalam Village, Kalimangalam Post, Melur Taluk, Madurai District. For Petitioner : No Appearance For Respondents :",
